NativeSupporterVault::collectYield
├── Given invalid bucket, unauthorized caller, disabled harvest, invalid cap, stale report or custody shortage
│   └── It cannot remove tokens
├── Given no carry, successful zero value, or an impaired bucket
│   └── It returns zero without a token transfer or manager callback
└── Given bounded recognized carry
    ├── It preserves ceil-reserved principal, basis and every lock
    ├── It does not net against the other bucket or sibling token
    ├── It transfers exactly to the fixed manager and authenticates inventory atomically
    └── When callback fails or reenters, it rolls back custody and harvested counters
